# Dashboard Asset Filters

- `FinancialDashboard2` (Modern Sleek) filters its Asset Performance Ledger table with a controlled search field and All, Property, and Auto category pills.
- `FinancialDashboard1` (Conservative) replaced its ledger table with an "Asset Performance" section: header, search, category pills, and a grid of asset cards ported from `FinancialDashboard3`. Card colors use theme tokens (the dashboard 3 originals are dark-only).

- Keep search and category filtering combined so each result satisfies both controls.
- Preserve the rounded search field and pill-shaped category buttons.
- Use semantic theme tokens for control colors and maintain visible focus states in light and dark themes.
- Keep the controls stacked at the existing responsive breakpoint (1056px on dashboard 2, 672px on dashboard 1).
